usage: sol do <app>.<action> [--name value ...] [--args JSON|-] [--json] [--dry-run] [--person ID]

Runs an action of an installed app, as you (or, with SOL_AGENT_KEY or --as-agent, as an agent).
Exit codes: 0 done, 1 failed, 2 bad arguments, 3 waiting for your approval (sol inbox).

Apps:
  files  4 actions  Your files on all your devices, shared with people you choose.
  notes  1 actions  Notes.

More: sol do --help <app>, sol do <app>.<action> --help
